              2881.0
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "Figure 10 shows the temperature profiles of three relative volatility cases. There is a sharp temperature profile for the case of  $ \\alpha_{390} = 2.00 $. This is especially true for the stripping section. The decrease of the value of  $ \\alpha_{390} $ moderates the sharpness of the temperature profile. The size of the hump in the reactive zone also",
